Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:14.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,Meet Music Meets Alexa —\Na voice-first music discovery experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:18.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,Choose friendship or a deeper connection, then ask\Nfor your daily listening brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:23.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,Three fictional people appear, each with a musical\Npersonality of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:40.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Start with a short introduction.\NAsk to see more, and a full profile\Nopens on your private screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:46.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tap a record label to hear an original\Nmelody, synthesized live in the browser.\NEven the heartbeat follows the real audio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:07.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ask why someone was recommended.\NYou will get two concrete reasons, plus something\Nwe honestly do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:12.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,You can even create a three-track mixtape, with\Na suggested opening line to start a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:29.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,Because voice assistants often live in shared spaces,\Nprivacy shapes every step.\NSpoken introductions stay brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:35.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,Full profiles appear only when requested.\NAnd your own music profile stays in your\Nbrowser —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.29,0:01:36.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,never on the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:55.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you would like to save an interest,\Nthe system asks twice.\NOnly after both confirmations does it become Pending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.49,0:01:59.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nobody is contacted automatically.\NJust a little celebration for a thoughtful choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:18.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,Behind this playful interface is a real, self-hosted\NMCP server with six tools, using Streamable HTTP\Nand JSON-RPC.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.63,0:02:26.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,Our browser-based Alexa-plus simulation calls those tools live.\NWe use Amazon Polly's Danielle voice for consistent\Nnarration across browsers —
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:32.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,not the official Alexa voice —\Nand WebAudio to synthesize original music in real\Ntime.
